161
00:14:10,084 --> 00:14:10,918
- [The Voice] Agent Chen,

162
00:14:10,951 --> 00:14:12,886
do I have your attention?

163
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:14,288
- [Lily] Who is this?

164
00:14:14,321 --> 00:14:16,323
